 248	### Desktop runs the real Nitro product
 249	
 250	The packaged Electron application must start the built Nitro application on
 251	`127.0.0.1` using an ephemeral port, wait for readiness, and load that HTTP
 252	origin. `file://` and a static custom protocol are not acceptable primary
 253	origins because Keating depends on same-origin APIs, cookies, WebSockets, OAuth,
 254	courses, sharing, provider proxying, and runtime configuration.
 255	
 256	Electron main owns Nitro lifecycle, P2P, native permissions, deep links,
 257	external navigation, OS secret storage, and the validated preload boundary.
 258	Mutable state lives beneath `app.getPath("userData")`, never inside resources or
 259	ASAR.
